WEBVTT

00:33.580 --> 00:37.020
=Royal Upstart 2=
(Based on "Zhenguan Foolish Son-in-Law")

00:37.460 --> 00:40.020
=Episode 1=

00:40.020 --> 00:42.780
(Selling Hotpot in Ancient Times)

00:43.020 --> 00:45.220
Four people drink
four buckets of water in four days.

00:45.420 --> 00:48.100
Then, how many buckets
do eight people drink in eight days?

00:48.620 --> 00:51.820
One person drinks one bucket a day.

00:51.860 --> 00:54.500
So eight people should
drink eight buckets in eight days.

00:54.500 --> 00:55.180
Wrong!

00:58.020 --> 01:00.260
(Wei Hao)
You don't know the multiplication table,

01:00.700 --> 01:01.980
(Modern Science Talent)
so if we're talking about arithmetic,

01:02.180 --> 01:03.500
(Ancient Fool)
in the entire Great Yong Dynasty,

01:03.500 --> 01:05.060
no one can outcalculate me!

01:05.940 --> 01:07.060
A fool

01:07.220 --> 01:10.140
dares to be so arrogant
in front of us scholars?

01:10.700 --> 01:13.060
Aren't you just a fool
who only knows how to fight?

01:13.060 --> 01:14.300
Keep babbling,

01:14.660 --> 01:15.860
and I'll beat you up!

01:16.620 --> 01:17.420
How dare you

01:18.500 --> 01:20.780
(Talent Recruitment Fair)
be so insolent at the Princess's recruitment fair!

01:22.060 --> 01:24.020
Why is this person so foolish?

01:24.580 --> 01:25.420
Your Highness,

01:25.700 --> 01:27.660
he is just a fool from the West City.

01:27.660 --> 01:28.380
(Wei Ning'an, Eldest Princess
of the Great Yong Dynasty)

01:28.380 --> 01:29.540
(A fool?)

01:30.060 --> 01:31.420
(She's so beautiful.)

01:32.340 --> 01:34.220
(No wonder my original self liked her.)

01:35.100 --> 01:35.900
Wei Hao,

01:36.380 --> 01:38.820
if you want to win
first place at the Princess's fair,

01:39.020 --> 01:40.060
you must first pass

01:40.100 --> 01:40.780
my test.

01:40.780 --> 01:41.340
Stop talking.

01:41.780 --> 01:42.580
Give me the problem.

01:42.820 --> 01:44.180
(Duan Lun, Minister of Works
of the Great Yong Dynasty)

01:44.180 --> 01:44.980
Fine.

01:45.460 --> 01:46.980
Listen carefully.

01:47.620 --> 01:48.660
A thief

01:48.660 --> 01:50.060
travels one li every quarter hour.

01:50.260 --> 01:53.570
A constable pursues him an hour later,
traveling three li every quarter hour.

01:53.580 --> 01:54.860
When will he catch up?

01:54.900 --> 01:56.860
This problem
took me a long time to study...

01:56.860 --> 01:58.500
He catches up in two quarters hour.

01:58.860 --> 02:00.340
Don't keep interrupting me.

02:04.020 --> 02:05.100
(Solved: Two quarters hour)

02:06.260 --> 02:07.660
Wei the Fool got it right.

02:09.380 --> 02:10.180
You...

02:10.220 --> 02:10.860
Sir.

02:11.980 --> 02:12.580
How...

02:12.780 --> 02:13.780
How is it possible?

02:14.100 --> 02:15.460
Such a complex problem,

02:15.460 --> 02:17.220
how could it be solved
in less than a day?

02:17.900 --> 02:19.300
Are you convinced?

02:19.700 --> 02:20.500
I am not.

02:21.700 --> 02:22.620
Wei Hao, you brat.

02:22.620 --> 02:24.380
Do you dare to take
another problem from me?

02:24.380 --> 02:25.140
No time.

02:25.140 --> 02:25.700
You...

02:25.820 --> 02:27.460
I came here today for the Princess.

02:27.540 --> 02:29.820
You have already delayed
my serious business,

02:29.820 --> 02:30.500
you know?

02:30.500 --> 02:30.740
I...

02:32.860 --> 02:33.780
Wei the Fool,

02:33.980 --> 02:34.820
don't be so arrogant.

02:35.540 --> 02:37.220
Even if you beat everyone here,

02:37.420 --> 02:38.380
you shouldn't make

02:38.390 --> 02:40.820
the boastful claim that no one
in Great Yong can outcalculate you.

02:40.940 --> 02:41.580
Girl,

02:42.060 --> 02:43.300
I didn't lie to you.

02:43.540 --> 02:44.500
If you don't believe me,

02:44.660 --> 02:47.020
you can call all the scholars
of the Great Yong Dynasty,

02:47.020 --> 02:48.420
including all those officials,

02:48.500 --> 02:50.180
to come and compete
with me in arithmetic.

02:50.180 --> 02:50.980
But

02:52.300 --> 02:54.260
if they all lose,

02:54.580 --> 02:55.860
you have to marry me.

02:56.660 --> 02:57.660
You rogue.

02:57.660 --> 02:58.580
Do you believe I'll...

02:58.580 --> 02:59.940
Don't call me a rogue all the time.

02:59.940 --> 03:00.940
Let me tell you...

03:03.220 --> 03:04.460
Although I'm called the "Fool",

03:04.460 --> 03:05.300
I'm not stupid.

03:05.580 --> 03:07.100
Don't listen to the rumors outside.

03:07.420 --> 03:08.220
If you follow me,

03:08.460 --> 03:09.780
I won't let you down.

03:09.900 --> 03:10.180
You...

03:10.180 --> 03:11.340
Then, it's a deal.

03:11.460 --> 03:12.660
Tomorrow at Juxian Restaurant,

03:12.740 --> 03:14.060
I'll be open to challenges.

03:14.300 --> 03:14.940
Girl, you...

03:14.940 --> 03:16.380
If you dare call me "Girl" again.

03:17.580 --> 03:18.740
You bring everyone you know

03:18.740 --> 03:20.540
who knows arithmetic.

03:20.620 --> 03:21.420
It's a deal.

03:22.700 --> 03:23.860
If they all lose to me,

03:25.340 --> 03:26.420
you marry me.

03:27.180 --> 03:27.500
You...

03:31.060 --> 03:32.020
Wei the Fool,

03:32.140 --> 03:33.100
you just wait.

03:33.740 --> 03:36.380
(Since I, a genius in the sciences,)

03:36.400 --> 03:38.460
(have traveled back in time
into this ancient fool,)

03:39.180 --> 03:41.590
(I shall help him fulfill
his wish of marrying the princess.)

03:42.580 --> 03:43.940
(But to be honest,)

03:44.540 --> 03:45.580
(as for this princess,)

03:46.060 --> 03:49.060
(I fell for her at first sight, too.)

03:50.860 --> 03:52.060
Accessories.

03:52.060 --> 03:53.660
(Talent Recruitment Hall)

03:53.660 --> 03:54.540
Little accessories.

03:54.540 --> 03:55.300
Young Master.

03:55.620 --> 03:56.220
Young Master,

03:56.420 --> 03:57.740
you really are here.

03:57.740 --> 03:59.900
Mister Wang, are you here
for the recruitment too?

04:00.420 --> 04:02.220
No, something happened at home.

04:02.220 --> 04:03.900
(Mister Wang, the Wei family steward)
Young Madam wants you to come back now.

04:03.940 --> 04:05.940
She's always overreacting.

04:06.420 --> 04:07.700
What could possibly happen?

04:10.300 --> 04:11.100
Mister Wang,

04:11.180 --> 04:12.340
you're not taking me home.

04:12.580 --> 04:13.860
Why did you bring me here?

04:13.940 --> 04:14.900
That's because we...

04:14.900 --> 04:15.540
Wei Hao.

04:16.740 --> 04:17.820
Wei Cong?

04:20.560 --> 04:21.820
Your family can no longer afford

04:21.820 --> 04:23.660
(Wei Cong, a Wei, Wei Hao's cousin)
to fund our clansmen from all over

04:23.660 --> 04:26.020
who came to the capital for the exams.

04:26.940 --> 04:28.540
To the clan,

04:28.620 --> 04:30.340
you no longer have any value.

04:30.700 --> 04:31.580
So,

04:32.420 --> 04:35.780
you're not qualified to live in
the Wei Mansion anymore.

04:36.060 --> 04:38.660
You only deserve to live
in this remote and messy courtyard.

04:39.060 --> 04:40.420
Keep pretending.

04:40.900 --> 04:41.900
Let me beat you to death.

04:41.900 --> 04:44.300
Young Master,
why are you getting violent again?

04:44.350 --> 04:45.660
They're insulting us at our doorstep.

04:45.660 --> 04:47.020
Am I usually this cowardly?

04:47.030 --> 04:47.540
Just you wait.

04:47.540 --> 04:48.500
I'm hitting you.

04:48.500 --> 04:49.300
Just you wait.

04:49.300 --> 04:50.220
I'll beat you to death.

04:52.200 --> 04:53.220
Where's my younger aunt?

04:53.220 --> 04:54.540
She's inside.

04:55.460 --> 04:56.260
Young Master.

04:57.940 --> 04:58.660
Aunt.

04:59.820 --> 05:02.100
(Lin Luo, sworn sister of Wei's mother)

05:02.460 --> 05:03.260
Hao,

05:04.420 --> 05:06.260
you're finally back.

05:07.060 --> 05:08.580
They are being such bullies.

05:09.620 --> 05:10.700
Who do they think they are?

05:10.700 --> 05:11.700
I'm going to find them.

05:12.980 --> 05:13.820
Where are you going?

05:14.060 --> 05:15.220
Are you going to fight again?

05:15.300 --> 05:17.420
Our family doesn't have
money for settlements anymore.

05:17.660 --> 05:19.180
Where did you hide my 600 guan of cash?

05:19.200 --> 05:20.020
Give it to me quickly.

05:20.020 --> 05:20.580
If I hand it to the clan,

05:20.580 --> 05:22.260
we can move back to
the Wei ancestral home.

05:22.260 --> 05:23.180
I used the money

05:23.420 --> 05:24.660
to buy a restaurant.

05:24.900 --> 05:25.780
In two months,

05:25.900 --> 05:27.220
I'll pay you back with interest.

05:28.060 --> 05:29.460
You spendthrift.

05:31.420 --> 05:33.020
(Juxian Restaurant)
Move a bit faster.

05:33.380 --> 05:33.740
Alright.

05:35.500 --> 05:37.980
Young Master, the copper pots from
the blacksmith are all set.

05:38.100 --> 05:39.220
I don't understand.

05:39.300 --> 05:41.460
Why is this copper pot
called a "hotpot"?

05:41.620 --> 05:42.260
Waiter.

05:42.660 --> 05:43.140
Come here.

05:44.260 --> 05:46.340
Buy a thousand portions
based on this recipe.

05:46.340 --> 05:47.190
How much will it cost?

05:48.100 --> 05:49.140
Boss,

05:49.500 --> 05:51.740
a thousand portions will cost five guan.

05:51.780 --> 05:52.660
Five guan?

05:52.820 --> 05:53.380
Is that a lot?

05:54.580 --> 05:55.220
Boss,

05:55.220 --> 05:56.300
let me put it this way.

05:56.300 --> 05:58.580
My monthly wage is only ten wen.

05:58.740 --> 05:59.580
To earn one guan,

05:59.980 --> 06:01.460
I'd have to work for ten months.

06:02.260 --> 06:04.460
(One wen is like
one yuan in the modern world,)

06:04.500 --> 06:07.020
(so one guan would be a hundred yuan.)

06:07.300 --> 06:07.860
Young Master,

06:08.140 --> 06:09.780
five guan really is a lot.

06:09.820 --> 06:11.540
If we can't afford it, let's get less.

06:11.540 --> 06:12.020
Young Madam...

06:12.020 --> 06:12.820
Don't worry.

06:13.180 --> 06:14.100
After today,

06:14.100 --> 06:15.980
hotpot will be a hit
all over the capital.

06:15.980 --> 06:17.260
When that time comes,

06:17.260 --> 06:18.370
I'll pay my aunt back a thousandfold.

06:18.380 --> 06:19.100
A hit?

06:19.100 --> 06:20.540
We don't even have a single customer.

06:20.540 --> 06:21.780
How can it be a hit?

06:21.780 --> 06:22.860
Is Wei Hao here?

06:25.060 --> 06:26.420
Isn't that a customer?

06:26.500 --> 06:27.460
Customer?

06:27.600 --> 06:28.660
What are you all waiting for?

06:28.660 --> 06:29.540
Go welcome them.

06:29.540 --> 06:30.520
- Right...
- Right...

06:34.860 --> 06:35.980
Greetings, sirs.

06:35.980 --> 06:36.980
Please come in, sirs.

06:38.380 --> 06:39.500
Please.

06:39.980 --> 06:41.540
So, you are Wei the Fool?

06:42.220 --> 06:43.660
Who are you calling a fool?

06:43.740 --> 06:44.740
Do I even know you?

07:00.580 --> 07:01.380
Wei Hao.

07:03.180 --> 07:06.380
Was it you who spoke so arrogantly
at the recruitment fair?

07:06.380 --> 07:07.940
(Dai Zou, Minister of Revenue of the Great Yong)
You claimed your arithmetic skills

07:07.940 --> 07:09.860
were unmatched in
the entire Great Yong Dynasty.

07:11.150 --> 07:12.740
So, you're the people the Princess sent?

07:12.740 --> 07:13.500
Today,

07:13.580 --> 07:15.980
I have brought the officials
from the Ministry of Revenue

07:16.420 --> 07:17.460
to test your mettle.

07:32.460 --> 07:33.780
The food is ready.

07:34.620 --> 07:34.980
This...

07:39.180 --> 07:40.180
What is this?

07:41.020 --> 07:41.940
It smells good.

07:43.290 --> 07:44.540
The scent makes my mouth water.

07:44.740 --> 07:46.380
This aroma is divine.

07:47.500 --> 07:48.660
What is this thing?

07:48.860 --> 07:50.980
The smell alone is making me salivate.

07:50.980 --> 07:51.980
The broth is boiling and fragrant.

07:51.980 --> 07:52.940
It's refreshing.

07:52.940 --> 07:55.380
This is the new dish
launched by Juxian Restaurant,

07:55.820 --> 07:57.060
a hotpot.

07:57.140 --> 07:58.060
Hotpot?

07:58.540 --> 08:00.300
I have never seen this before.

08:00.300 --> 08:00.980
However,

08:00.980 --> 08:03.180
it certainly smells exquisite.

08:03.180 --> 08:04.100
Indeed.

08:04.260 --> 08:05.900
I wonder if we might have a taste?

08:11.300 --> 08:12.540
If you want to compete, then compete.

08:12.580 --> 08:14.360
Don't stand around here
blocking my business.

08:14.380 --> 08:15.060
Fine.

08:15.200 --> 08:16.220
Wei Hao, here's the question.

08:17.020 --> 08:17.820
Not so fast.

08:19.020 --> 08:20.220
From now on,

08:20.220 --> 08:21.900
if you want to challenge me
in arithmetic,

08:21.980 --> 08:24.180
you must bet one guan per question.

08:24.340 --> 08:25.460
One guan?

08:25.460 --> 08:26.260
(Zhangsun Chong, Vice Minister of
Revenue of the Great Yong Dynasty)

08:26.260 --> 08:27.060
Wei the Fool,

08:27.180 --> 08:29.380
what if you can't answer
within 15 minutes?

08:29.820 --> 08:30.860
Then, I will

08:31.620 --> 08:33.580
pay out tenfold.

08:33.580 --> 08:34.780
I'll give you ten guan.

08:35.700 --> 08:36.700
Oh, my young master.

08:36.700 --> 08:37.500
With so many people,

08:37.580 --> 08:38.620
paying ten guan to each...

08:38.620 --> 08:39.060
This is...

08:43.100 --> 08:44.100
Bring it on.

08:46.020 --> 08:46.820
I'll go first.

08:51.260 --> 08:53.700
Suppose there is a rope one chi long.

08:53.700 --> 08:56.500
If it is formed into a circle,
what is its vertical length?

08:56.500 --> 08:57.620
Can you answer that?

08:57.860 --> 08:58.180
This...

08:58.380 --> 09:00.380
How can we calculate this
without a ruler,

09:00.380 --> 09:01.140
Young Master?

09:04.820 --> 09:07.340
(c = 1 chi)
Isn't this just finding the diameter from the circumference?

09:09.300 --> 09:10.220
(d = c/π)
One chi divided by

09:10.220 --> 09:11.940
(d = 1/3.1415926)
3.1415926.

09:12.580 --> 09:13.700
Absolute nonsense.

09:14.540 --> 09:15.700
What is the

09:16.460 --> 09:19.420
"3.1415926"

09:19.420 --> 09:20.340
you are talking about?

09:22.340 --> 09:22.860
You...

09:24.180 --> 09:24.940
What's wrong?

09:25.220 --> 09:27.100
That was written by Zu Chongzhi.

09:27.500 --> 09:29.020
It has existed for many years.

09:29.780 --> 09:33.740
(d ≈ 0.3183, 1 chi ≈ 3.18 cun)
The vertical length is three cun, one fen, and eight li.

09:35.060 --> 09:35.700
How...

09:36.100 --> 09:36.900
How...

09:37.620 --> 09:39.380
How did you calculate so quickly?

09:40.860 --> 09:42.060
It took my chief registrars

09:42.260 --> 09:44.740
several days to come up with
three cun and two fen.

09:44.740 --> 09:46.260
But you were even accurate to eight li.

09:46.260 --> 09:49.140
I told you,
I'm the world's No. 1 in arithmetic.

09:49.220 --> 09:50.020
Next.

09:50.100 --> 09:50.580
Me.

09:51.500 --> 09:52.700
He's way too arrogant.

09:52.820 --> 09:53.700
Stump him.

09:53.900 --> 09:54.700
I'll go next.

09:58.740 --> 10:00.380
I don't believe you can solve this.

10:00.420 --> 10:02.180
The wood needed to build the bridge is

10:02.300 --> 10:03.140
3,500 pieces.

10:03.540 --> 10:04.060
Next.

10:04.740 --> 10:05.540
Next.

10:06.420 --> 10:07.500
This is my question.

10:08.540 --> 10:09.760
The length of the water tank is

10:10.180 --> 10:11.660
three chi and eighty-seven fen.

10:11.820 --> 10:12.620
Next.

10:12.980 --> 10:15.620
The raw meat must be three
wen cheaper to break even.

10:16.540 --> 10:17.060
Next.

10:17.060 --> 10:17.940
Young Master.

10:19.980 --> 10:20.620
Next.

10:21.260 --> 10:21.980
Next.

10:22.980 --> 10:23.580
Next.

10:25.140 --> 10:25.820
I... This...

10:29.340 --> 10:30.140
Look at this...

10:36.260 --> 10:37.060
Young Master.

10:43.500 --> 10:44.700
Sirs, those who have lost

10:44.780 --> 10:47.940
can have a free
hotpot meal at this restaurant.

10:50.740 --> 10:51.420
Well...

10:51.780 --> 10:54.020
I've been enduring
this delicious smell for a long time.

10:54.580 --> 10:55.860
I lost one guan.

10:56.420 --> 10:56.820
Come on.

10:56.820 --> 10:57.220
Let's eat it back.

10:57.220 --> 11:00.020
Those who lost a lot
can go to the private rooms upstairs.

11:01.380 --> 11:02.660
I lost three questions.

11:03.260 --> 11:04.060
Three guan.

11:04.060 --> 11:04.820
And me.

11:04.940 --> 11:06.380
I lost three guan too.

11:06.380 --> 11:06.940
Go, go.

11:06.940 --> 11:07.300
Alright.

11:07.300 --> 11:08.180
Have a seat anywhere.

11:10.860 --> 11:13.220
Anyway, we can make up
for the loss by eating.

11:13.260 --> 11:14.460
Go on, gentlemen.

11:31.700 --> 11:34.140
The fatty beef is like
snow melting on the lips,

11:35.340 --> 11:37.900
and tripe gently caresses the throat.

11:41.140 --> 11:42.740
Such a delicacy on earth.

11:43.820 --> 11:45.740
It tastes even better than it smells.

11:53.620 --> 11:54.260
Wei...

11:54.540 --> 11:55.420
Wei Hao,

11:56.540 --> 11:58.780
I should be the one
to ask the final question.

11:58.980 --> 12:00.220
But I'm hungry.

12:00.220 --> 12:02.140
Can I have a taste first?

12:02.140 --> 12:02.780
No.

12:09.000 --> 12:10.500
(Do they really think
I have nothing better to do)

12:10.500 --> 12:12.300
(than to find them
to compete in arithmetic?)

12:12.780 --> 12:14.860
(After today, my Juxian Restaurant will
surely become famous in the capital)

12:14.860 --> 12:16.180
(and become the most
expensive restaurant.)

12:16.580 --> 12:18.820
(This marketing was a success.)

12:22.420 --> 12:23.700
He really is a fool?

12:23.980 --> 12:24.860
It's true.

12:24.940 --> 12:26.780
I didn't believe it at first either,

12:26.820 --> 12:29.100
but everyone in West City says so.

12:29.100 --> 12:30.020
This Wei Hao

12:30.020 --> 12:31.300
fights in the streets all day.

12:31.500 --> 12:32.300
It feels like

12:32.580 --> 12:34.180
(Chan, Eldest Princess's personal maid)
he's missing a screw.

12:34.260 --> 12:35.180
He's very impulsive.

12:36.500 --> 12:38.860
No wonder he behaves so recklessly.

12:39.000 --> 12:40.780
Turns out there's
something wrong with his head.

12:43.020 --> 12:45.620
His family used to be
the richest in West City.

12:46.340 --> 12:47.860
His parents went to Bashu,

12:47.900 --> 12:49.780
so he's being raised
by her younger aunt now.

12:51.340 --> 12:52.700
Well, no wonder then.

12:53.020 --> 12:55.860
The only son of the family
and the only heir in five generations.

12:59.380 --> 13:00.380
I wonder

13:01.060 --> 13:03.940
how those court officials
are doing with their bets.

13:05.460 --> 13:06.740
Is it Juxian Restaurant?

13:07.540 --> 13:08.060
Let's go.

13:08.100 --> 13:09.660
Let's go see him make a fool of himself.

13:21.140 --> 13:23.970
♪Everyone says I'm a big silly fool♪

13:24.590 --> 13:27.990
♪When things happen,
I only know how to count on my fingers♪

13:28.760 --> 13:31.710
♪They shake their heads
and say I'm pitiful♪

13:32.050 --> 13:34.750
♪Sigh and walk away♪

13:36.350 --> 13:39.820
♪Little do they know,
I am sharp and bright♪

13:39.820 --> 13:42.050
♪With a heart like a mirror,
I understand the world's♪

13:42.050 --> 13:44.160
♪Colors and darkness♪

13:44.160 --> 13:46.180
♪But I keep my edge hidden♪

13:46.180 --> 13:50.540
♪The day I become famous
is just around the corner♪

13:51.980 --> 13:55.710
♪In the hotpot restaurant,
skewers boil in the broth♪

13:55.980 --> 13:59.580
♪People come and go,
with few worries or troubles♪

13:59.740 --> 14:01.820
♪The clacking of the abacus rings out♪

14:01.820 --> 14:06.610
♪See me differently.
Who dares to challenge me?♪

14:06.830 --> 14:08.450
♪The world mistakes me♪

14:08.450 --> 14:10.790
♪For an ignorant and stubborn fool♪

14:10.860 --> 14:12.050
♪As the storm approaches♪

14:12.050 --> 14:14.450
♪I just shrug and watch with a smile♪

14:14.660 --> 14:16.380
♪This foolish image is convenient♪

14:16.380 --> 14:18.360
♪I use it as a protective shield♪

14:18.530 --> 14:20.280
♪Navigating with ease, I attract♪

14:20.280 --> 14:22.380
♪A lucky star to accompany me♪

14:22.380 --> 14:23.850
♪In a peaceful golden age♪

14:23.850 --> 14:26.080
♪I hold my lady's hand
to watch the world♪

14:26.300 --> 14:27.500
♪Pouring youth and fireworks♪

14:27.500 --> 14:30.020
♪Into a precious glazed cup♪

14:30.150 --> 14:31.860
♪Having experienced life's changes♪

14:31.860 --> 14:33.140
♪And tasted its highs and lows♪

14:33.290 --> 14:34.710
♪My wish has finally come true♪

14:34.710 --> 14:35.750
♪To stay by your side♪

14:35.750 --> 14:37.670
♪In this fleeting world♪

14:37.840 --> 14:41.090
♪We are free and happy♪

14:45.090 --> 14:46.870
♪From a nobody♪

14:46.870 --> 14:48.770
♪To someone now famous♪

14:48.880 --> 14:50.310
♪Ordinary people laugh at me♪

14:50.310 --> 14:52.820
♪But I laugh at how they
cannot see through it all♪

14:52.920 --> 14:54.500
♪Let others plot and scheme♪

14:54.500 --> 14:56.570
♪I will keep my heart unchanged♪

14:56.780 --> 14:58.460
♪In this vast world♪

14:58.460 --> 15:00.460
♪I find my own leisurely freedom♪

15:00.610 --> 15:02.820
♪The world is bustling,
and things constantly change♪

15:02.820 --> 15:04.410
♪Everything ends eventually♪

15:04.500 --> 15:06.000
♪All that remains before my eyes♪

15:06.000 --> 15:08.400
♪Is this street wandering,
still tinged with pity♪

15:08.400 --> 15:10.110
♪No matter how time flies♪

15:10.110 --> 15:11.270
♪Even if the falling snow♪

15:11.270 --> 15:12.900
♪Dyes the hair at our temples white♪

15:12.900 --> 15:13.940
♪All I want now♪

15:13.940 --> 15:16.040
♪Is to pray for
my lady's peace and safety♪

15:16.040 --> 15:19.300
♪Year after year♪
